• Coordinate technology and innovation projects from idea to execution;
• Translate business needs into clear requirements, user stories and actionable project deliverables;
• Support project planning and budget management, tracking costs, resources and priorities;
• Work closely with technical teams, clients, partners and suppliers;
• Track progress, anticipate risks and ensure effective follow-up;
• Explore opportunities where AI and technology can address business challenges;
• Translate between business and technical perspectives;
• Lead meetings, workshops and project discussions with different stakeholders;
• Communicate projects, ideas and technology use cases clearly to different audiences;
